==Description==
The '''CircuitHacker Nametag''' is a nametag that is obtained by completing the ''Corrupted Touch'' [[Mission Quests|Mission]].

The '''CircuitHacker Nametag''' has yellow text and a green outline. Multiple green and yellow triangles are emitted from the nametag. Behind the text, circuits can be seen going from right to left.

==Trivia==
*The '''CircuitHacker Nametag''' is the second nametag available to be obtained from a [[Mission Quests|Mission]].

